cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this interface in research, please cite this software and identify
  the release or commit used. Also cite NAMD, its QM/MM implementation,
  TURBOMOLE, and any methods used, as described in REFERENCES.md.
type: software
title: "TURBOMOLE–NAMD QM/MM Interface"
abstract: >-
  A Python adapter connecting NAMD's custom QM interface to TURBOMOLE,
  with VMD preparation templates and synthetic protocol tests.
authors:
  - family-names: Jiang
    given-names: Hao
    affiliation: "Department of Biochemistry and Biophysics, Stockholm University"
    email: hao.jiang@dbb.su.se
license: MIT
keywords:
  - QM/MM
  - NAMD
  - TURBOMOLE
  - computational chemistry
